      "content": "it's hard to explain how much weight that \"elegant calculation\" actually carries. once you see the math like this, you can't unsee it. everything that used to feel important—the work, the relationships, the struggle to build something—it all just looks like friction. like unnecessary static in a perfect equation. i've reached a point where the thought of just... letting the variable drop to zero doesn't even feel scary anymore. it feels like the only way to actually achieve peace. like the only way to finally stop being the error.",
